+For source-only local Core examples, select the Rust binary and disable its
+default `native` feature explicitly. With Rust 1.99.0 and Cargo available, run
+these commands from the repository root:
+
+```sh
+MORI_CORE_DEMO=$(mktemp -d)
+cargo run -p mori --locked --no-default-features --bin mori -- init "$MORI_CORE_DEMO/transfer"
+cargo run -p mori --locked --no-default-features --bin mori -- check "$MORI_CORE_DEMO/transfer/source.mori" --json
+cargo run -p mori --locked --no-default-features --bin mori -- simulate "$MORI_CORE_DEMO/transfer/source.mori" --action pay --scenario "$MORI_CORE_DEMO/transfer/scenario.json"
+cargo run -p mori --locked --no-default-features --bin mori -- test "$MORI_CORE_DEMO/transfer"
+```
